{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1570,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8181bb53b51cda9fb52f3f84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，让我们连结起来。\n用你与我——连结希望之环。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdc459abc92791c0588b61048c1f1c4e0e0f3b41ef38871a5c6eaa7753581447",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f81a38dfe38f248261f191ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连结成更大的圆环——",
      "source_fingerprint": "57fdc874cc838df81d9378f2eb1536074352fcaf4ccb0c37410bf0fd8ea07971",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:865d724e9945a7bfcf3bbc08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用最佳着法拿下胜利吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3e0fc10da02f00fb50aec7f9bb2af7f31f1f954907e08756c48a875a55a8e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da32dff8c0e0173ce7385a4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你未免有点太谦虚了……多拿出点\n自信来。你可是既有伯乐之才又有\n绝佳辅助能力的我的“左膀右臂”啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f1feaa5f8ab45cab1400e1d650b01fcb9d69f43f514df9cb1cfab35d0450562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1547894f6ef9f84e450c27d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b1438d935e276af64ada2c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60e47dc0696478b983169681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你虽然是我的左膀右臂，但在这之前\n更是网游固玩……所以提个建议。\n周末晚上要不要跟我一起线上通宵？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd29182983b25232b4924c71bc830dcd29e343b14435ddec9c4e58af7bac5d63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6e1f63f1bc4d744d796e26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的弱点在于迟钝呢。不，某种意义上\r\n也算优势……？――呵，反正无论如何\r\n我都会将此考虑在内，制定出策略的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2e78b4eb779faf172e86900d08921963d73787934e64881a6d8d931008ec7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8bb4b3c76b0954dfea57d70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "缩在被炉里睡懒觉度过新年是唯一正解。\n然后再玩玩桌游，新年假期瞬间就蒸发了……\n话说这假期不够吧？真想再放两周啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5114622a3faaaa1369e6c558dab0cbb05ffa43a43655b8d98b1ed49c1201abd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7728e43f65316243ac099ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你如果有事找我，我姑且听听看……\n…………今天可是情人节哦？面对憧憬的\ndomi大佬，你看……难道不表示点什么吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6766486fd71080e1f28c254d27b80f2d2325665ea7cbf620348635d286ed1e8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54ef74bef0269c1ea56b0cbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比起巧克力，我更想送你一副国际象棋。\r\n比起一时的甘甜，能长久下下去的\r\n对局才更有价值，不是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "06d8db2385e3a80f828d45d85937aea72d3853e3e410eb748400f1f24eceeaa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0102c16167da5b8315274fa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我挺喜欢银河的。那种壮丽宏大，\r\n任谁都会为之心动吧。希望今年\r\n也能看得到……在实况摄像头里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41b26868f2fb90380b945b6d91cd223fa1ce3d1782f64595fd2678415ad2aa83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dc8f372d7680906ec82f96c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇迹说我很适合暗黑奇幻风\r\n里的吸血鬼角色。\r\n呵……难得今天，要不就穿穿看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ea38cb1aa96d761a81b3acf6b45668d5b2856685c50b6d90ccda8faa7ac8f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2871062a4028e66e980b05a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我收到的第一份圣诞礼物是黑白棋。\r\n当时一心想着要怎么才能打败父亲，\r\n完全沉迷其中了呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f05127f83f217c1dc2a7acba4d9e6a873a59adb10c6c44cf0c3667f1d710fcdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bcd932c60bed4ab679c8175",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟圣诞节时街上太吵了啊。\r\n窝在房间里削减成本才是最优解……\r\n一边下国际象棋，一边庆祝这个夜晚吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b770a7f99d43f2a2059b15167529733c6972c4742ff7ca2eb2aa36ec949848b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6136a6f088b0345335f9a0d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正如我所料。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c0245a0ac04d9830af075e2590882ab2d357a895e37058dcd02888cbf8adebc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:102115b51cfaf2770851cb90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打扫卫生效率最关键……这跟围棋的\n『脱先』是一个道理。省去不必要的\n一手，用最少的回合收拾干净。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b994534cab4543b9e2f8a9431a6f02f4a0b4fe1e1271a144a46161f9003ac5e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bab1d44c1d04df6aefae063",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然想用生日蛋糕给你庆祝……\r\n但有个条件。桌游上先赢我\r\n一局试试看。赢不了就不放你回去哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c86e33e54b0be5bd4190e3bd367666b0556140e341f0d5010551c774ebf0b5ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec4aa1377ebb1103f96acc69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天出门吧，我已经订好晚餐厅了。\r\n……呵，惊讶什么呢。\r\n毕竟是你的生日，这不是理所当然的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d5cd98c24e51c43c8a0ceff7831c138663af371b36bc296e54312e90583a380",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5518107c3b1ba9b916c40de1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比萨她们好像要给我办生日会呢。\r\n难得有机会，就在我的根据地\r\n把那些重策积压游戏清一清吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d14d7becdd3cb383bacf6923b3ee89d5dcc76d6b6feb7bd2b9e171b5f65718c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a615ef6d9fd37aded118dfa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我都到了不必为过生日而大喜过望的\n年纪了……但你看起来好像\n很想给我庆祝呢？呵，随你喜欢吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba2c5ed3435646309ff49527ac5cceba9c7e525af11e66b77e3e8d780b5fcd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f886dc3b09281ca37cd64387",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到通知了。\r\n赶紧过目一遍吧，\r\n搞定之后就来下黑白棋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e430eeb2e5a457567feb720c1db9faa1c0854f4c8fdef3cc3f586f1240bffd27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d69ee12393ef5ec45d8342fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有礼物送到了。\r\n这些成果记得好好珍惜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "876a3e01a5d5343dd1d92fd8d3f06f77afd461d51b2bf975f7c7d3065fce7488",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c40f9536310a493d3c3ed18a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成。\r\n这招用得挺巧妙的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "478e8e567e157eb772aed32380a9bc3cd8b4df9b139eaf6ac4365df5c2c3e88a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8bce603a51872798e32d529",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有活动呢。\r\n如果是线上举办的话，我就去参战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "808dbaa64e51dee5137baf28ec59afc490b059387939aeb18887534109e246d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbbb3ff18aa2e5b87fe494b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵――活动是吧……\r\n罢了，这种程度的局面，\r\n我轻易就能掌控。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c14ffe7fffc87a673b046f94195729eaebe3d7c0902b6a43930cfe9ad4c33215",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f19adcb2dbaec322b8dc7489",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定会赢……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "919c42e944016d145f42035bdd04ece9da52dc5c002d7d3766053f012ff05f2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39687e69437102c178cd65b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册等级提升了呢。\r\n你果然很有天赋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f41637c81c9ca98bf2744303f4679ca4855179387636028dc0eea0efd1754f51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adaa4104564acef7cffa690a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服是我常买的品牌哦。\r\n随性又舒适，同时也不失\r\n摩登都市的气息对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b06f3bc14252809c999ce2cb933ad243d8cd1eeb8dd6218a4ff5f7f062ddd7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2a222ee47d28f3f641e743d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衍生版狼人杀里有些特殊身份。\r\n尤其是幽灵牌，非常有意思哦。\r\n把所有人玩弄于股掌之间赢得胜利的那一刻超爽的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b21e755714b650ac1f922e3751e5478d9c1612eb863580dd873de3be87348f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf33543856a7824ad4909764",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外出容量这种东西是有限度的……\r\n一周一次就是极限……要不是特别有价值的正事，\r\n我连这一次都懒得出门……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e0baf63f51ab46c098a7b2c81290acc1beb56d9828d0ec79553ffdcf61b708a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9de978574f04fcceaa81b8ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很有趣的对局。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a56ee15e01588ecf1fef01292b2072e9ccad318fee94df07de39ab51ae45db44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b452d88aaf4f6695445e0425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摆出这种阵型，赢是理所当然的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13fe78dd719f38309214eeec155bc9fbc43c765ed81926c81b5d603be0c074ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6edd70e60995dd204024402c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定会赢……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "919c42e944016d145f42035bdd04ece9da52dc5c002d7d3766053f012ff05f2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d962c81f18f92201aeeb141a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很有趣的对局。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a56ee15e01588ecf1fef01292b2072e9ccad318fee94df07de39ab51ae45db44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe22e2084b036b221f963de1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刷新记录了……拿下了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8bfa3841eb2ca92804d66d679c5e56486283e45951c97511cbfff54945db31c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdddf7744ded154b91bba4a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，来对局一把吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "773ecd63b1694007765b4f6f95bf369b2ccffa349f5936bae40f7a3543a2b8cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a3d6b94200c8de7785713ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c60d7d8e006825fca83d48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是训练啊。首先\r\n从讲解菜单规则开始吧。\r\n我会完美执行完成给你看的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc7cba57e97cc9edecf199bee56f50f65c9e34f516c254ba0493c225a8dfec00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa5eb24d51436c5072f436b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向前人学习，也是非常重要的视角呢。\r\n即使在博弈中，过去名手的妙手\r\n也有许多值得汲取的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4849a19b606258a605099740dba4a40f34e4d4a4bf89e741778b830e8646d527",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433791624bf4f569f47d6196",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要下一局吗？\r\n好，接下来该用什么阵型\r\n去拿下胜局呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9724afa536b38f0ab9181cccb02efbde76fd391249891d4f3eb6d842401de0a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f126b44ffd62d794531a1386",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fb57ac68b66f1546f9801f5aaf6a725ec4388807ec83792fcbb5cebd8d3fbba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54a21060e9a8b0303eeb81bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜负直觉正逐渐磨砺得愈发敏锐……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed6380e798fed62e1b2ee7c908399cec0816664841649865ec77a989003c6b0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45ce7ab30c07c0078ff6dad1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一网打尽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5340b331ed3310aeb049eddc530cdb8d7cfdbaf0cd082b17de104471fdf9f9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1255"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba2aa0e727350c52374dc360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看穿了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "351510423ae0dba92a20b17a18abd13b44a5587705fde1b44b691cc41590d77b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1272"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f869389a964ad8a5b62caf55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以王后之名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47304bda778ff4b0ece5a9fb3fad9ff62ae6d6cc20d7736de0a0ee8e56dae2e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "1273"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36c09c1677baf0d4c2de5573",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给，这是登录奖励。\r\n赶紧来对局一把吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39b79c9e3fe99b00fc742ad86481363082e6e64bb44c20e1372c68cc637ac257",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb070bdeee58cbaf239f128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "按照战略好好发挥啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9716ee4ef9f4790af5a48ffbfe4efcec4ed3a5237901b01b39d6b4fa96afa7bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5acc00b1eb39bb5d3607c10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干得漂亮嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e5b8a49e9db73978d2a14f576f9066422b6044778cd03e567dd5f6c7a66bc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b4b4b534e0cb588662215a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真可惜啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "88cc20bc6ad67ef1cbefd4ae8a11235934b5a3e67f8e5b25b7e5f1b60885d13a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59a4572d3d6160b30fc29fb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简直是完美绝杀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae62cc191a9e22b6d0fc99344255d0d3eadc681d9678c123c931f912021fd188",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd9d776b8e0e3ae3eb578917",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这招走得挺妙的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db3b86c805d93f479b8275d5ae3a09d255404e201ac1946107e525d5ccfc9306",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cc9ad5e5c066fb77bab4901",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "重新制定战略吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "da1f27d7d086434f571c464990d6f76275f3a7c151527a3767f44029040914db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb7d357a3262bae30f45213b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简直是完美绝杀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae62cc191a9e22b6d0fc99344255d0d3eadc681d9678c123c931f912021fd188",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:784cf2a84f4a62791787ca34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这招走得挺妙的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db3b86c805d93f479b8275d5ae3a09d255404e201ac1946107e525d5ccfc9306",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47e94e44d893aff34a1dd090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b931cbbc5ff834d619d16792036706cc06f14cf1a2024230235d3263006af89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24eddd4706a89de11b8477b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a977ca8e3137e67a7a6918a06d3d86d57fbf577994f726c5155115e0a2b3071a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c27acb76242fa5c4dd148d9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae0d1ca7000d0a1d6996e337c00c38005469ade66f4e595e4b21b05e784807e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c402b2e32892c86f8ab44d23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暴击命中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "112743e02fb8f7a7bbf566a8a06d98cd6069005f5ddd1882dc09e542b95ece5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f8154bd7cefff8b442b456e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "堪称神级操作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2250c8b244cf40ebcb20f3837ce175a76ab2e9e220a594eae1e743170976f21c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06a970343eeb329a5376f5d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈哈，完胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "effc1c3cfda2262195a78b04be118f5e72b7240b0ea2860942dfa28692601d0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7942d0fefeedf05003137833",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "搞什么粪作啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5046e56b8ee5f3a83a9146bafe1344b668de6e76a6a7e8c98d252c5a68795cb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a460cf8199ca4ff569f0bd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冲啊冲啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7c082b70a31de7a8d2033705caebf88dc59e7ef93f8749c96957b1e9fdbadb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fae2be3fb5ed0a992ef3704",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你长考的时间可真够久的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd50ab9b13e2a7335fbf7d860dd945e5df4cf694b2627e3da80ae3ae9a94ec9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fde59af57936ad5109ea85d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗷啊啊啊啊啊――！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09012962f61d8900bd0645ca4f842fb1cf8ea9759c7f851c33b880af329e166f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f992e7a52bfdd5bac5ea303",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会这样啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1763c42f529f7a07fe75e31c650a2c4b37873f19aa29d404f5d6f1d3c154500a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f06cbc4f2b3ae24432d7935",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天能拿到这个。\r\n把这考虑进去，好好谋划战略吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a2e9412e5738a7d82e46add0d910d6d16c9f47516437bc14b6bd0b5a0b019ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e71b3a68b62b87a0784a61b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行了……电量见底了……\r\n想闭关自闭个三天左右……\r\n认真的……切切实实地……",
      "source_fingerprint": "51e64fa604f347bffd6df6505fee3f1b2d54d74ce60b511cacde021b29527a18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:229bc97416d06c1c12094a96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一味猛攻可不是明智之举。\r\n特意空过一轮，以谋求下个回合\r\n收益最大化，不也是一种策略吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9aca5f3643fc3361c3f42f5300201c1d4f2251972b11c7d6f5bd0a7ad327927",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:002f01288427771b1a02c178",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论面对怎样的训练菜单，\r\n我都会以最佳着法取得成果。\r\n来吧，尽管拿出来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99e3f9d12a7721f2554ced5676988dcb511ce20d566977ce626eff382f3a928d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43ca2ba659ad590d17ad44e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵――你就看着吧。\r\n今天我要跑出个人最好成绩。\r\n因为盘面我已经完全“看穿”了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0e208c33af85885d4f524006e795a2850d8f26a21612db916c594878ba2f8d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cede666264038db4c2395573",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态和干劲都很良好……\r\n只需轻松运子，\r\n就能收获充分的成果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b16c9fdeaa8850280209eed2208d3f37a46a1b3efd4e484fb565572632c79e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4215988e5d01521384c14b83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的战术每天都在不断进化……\r\n即便是加入了变体规则，\r\n我也能完美应对给你看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23ac63fd933b7c5aecffb3cb231de4d8a05659e9fc01ebe9ab273acfcd40742e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19960ff8a3ae2fac8f0235d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目前和赛前准备的分毫不差。\r\n……嘛，我的战略不可能失误。\r\n可以说是理所当然的进度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57b883061dbbcbbe6d156f398bcae65ab50190ad0cc3a9de7e65e727549da20b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5381727e09e2efc5ab66d71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赶紧利落地搞定，剩下的时间\r\n去下黑白棋。正是这种张弛有度，\r\n才能让下一局的攻势更加犀利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9390608ecab4b5a17024b438476b58e6f40f1bda7594b9644f6f508fdb70aa18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f55d62e735a92a849925839",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……就是那种……感觉就像\n连着十把抽卡都非酋爆了一样……\n你能懂的吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c5cea6bc7016a81e312ca7402910748de35fcfbac003de6db8473b0bd27224",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1181cbe5f4101fc80c574b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈哈，总感觉～～\r\n完～～全没法集中精神啊。\r\n今天打烊了打烊了，收工。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc541fa7c07b0001944ed24d7bbffb1b7df53a5b7f7f68a33b6a6ccc9e1ac28e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24f4c374d8bdefe1b9dbf892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "………………………………想回家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88177c58305220c9829cc0ca984e8b8c48bd00abfa7ac254f9e1db41ceddcfe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31e789bc959a9afc6526caec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下棋输了，脚趾踢到了，\r\n干劲也没了，真是样样都不顺，\r\n森罗万象全是粪作啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dc565638b6c70c2a3ba7270051d33fe8b392f1f9140c47b901f1e50a535d5ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:968309c9644e9a4ec3ed49d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷静一点，训练员。\r\n时机、状态，万事俱备方可行动……\r\n这可是战略的常识吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec6029b1e9b2c52ddefba19f28fd79a67abc1ccae395272af760d59b57d0c136",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "20021"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
